        "title": "Exchange log",
        "description": "What each parent recorded about exchanges — happened as planned, late, or not at all — and where a child actually was on a day that went otherwise. Every entry is one parent's account, stamped by the hub with who gave it and when; the other parent's answer, if any, is its own entry. Nothing here is edited or deleted.",
        "source": {
          "kind": "sql",
          "query": "SELECT COALESCE(r.day, l.day) AS day, COALESCE(r.child_id, l.child_id) AS child, l.kind AS kind, l.actual_time AS actual_time, l.parent_id AS with_parent, l.note AS note, l.created_by AS recorded_by, l.created_at AS recorded_at, r.created_by AS answers, r.kind AS answers_kind, r.created_at AS answers_recorded_at FROM app_co_parenting__custody_log l LEFT JOIN app_co_parenting__custody_log r ON r.id = l.responds_to_id WHERE l.day >= :range_start AND l.day <= :range_end ORDER BY COALESCE(r.day, l.day), COALESCE(r.child_id, l.child_id), l.created_at"
